╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│  Legend                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Session                                                                                          │
│   ●             session attached (tmux) · agent working (Herdr)                                  │
│   ●             agent blocked — waiting on you (Herdr)                                           │
│   ○             session detached (tmux) · agent idle or done (Herdr)                             │
│   ·             no session (dashboard row)                                                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Git status                                                                                       │
│   ●N            N modified/changed files                                                         │
│   ↑N            N commits ahead of upstream                                                      │
│   ↓N            N commits behind upstream                                                        │
│   ✓ clean       nothing modified/diverged                                                        │
│   ⤳ no upstream branch has no upstream tracking ref                                              │
│   ?             dirty-state load error                                                           │
│   ⠋             dirty-state loading (spinner)                                                    │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Rows & selection                                                                                 │
│   ↓             remote-only repo (not cloned; clone on select)                                   │
│   ●N            open-issue count on a repo row                                                   │
│   ▸             selected row (picker list/sessions, create row)                                  │
│   +             dashboard action row: create a new worktree                                      │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Header                                                                                           │
│   ●N open       repo open-issue count                                                            │
│   ✎ <names>     present note files, e.g. ✎ ideas.md · TODO.md                                    │
│                                                                                                  │
│ ? / esc to close                                                                                 │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯